  "title": "Time Attendance APIs — Create / Edit",
  "entity": "HCMv3.TimeManagement.TimeAttAPI",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>The connection to the time-attendance system (BioTime) that punches are imported from. The same settings appear under <strong>Integration Center → BioTime</strong>, which can also test the connection.</p>",
